          "briefDescription": "Chhattisgarh State Government started a scheme \"Kisan Samriddhi Yojana\" for farmer.",
          "detailedDescription": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "This scheme provide grant to farmers on tube well mining and pump installation. The main objective of the scheme is to increase the productivity and crop intensity by making proper use of available ground water through tube wells and providing irrigation facilities to the crops."
